WEBVTT

00:00:01.017 --> 00:00:10.187
Next asks which configuration the patient leaves on. The one marked as the final settings is chosen already; Not noted is also possible.

00:00:17.832 --> 00:00:24.401
Finish summarises the session: how many configurations were tested, and the final settings as their values.

00:00:28.216 --> 00:00:33.694
Reports for the patient record come out as PDF or Word, on A4 or US Letter.

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:42.906
For research, the BIDS folder is exported as a zip.

00:00:44.884 --> 00:00:48.434
Close ends the session. Everything is already saved.

